msgid "What&#8217;s new"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 2.7.1.Final, our first maintenance release for "
"our 2.7 release train.\n"
"It contains bugfixes and documentation improvements, but also a couple of "
"new features, filling a few gaps."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a safe upgrade for anyone already using 2.7."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not using 2.7 already, please refer to the https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.7[2.7 migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kogito extensions are back"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"2.7.1.Final reintroduces the Kogito extensions that were disabled for 2.7.0."
"Final due to an incompatibility.\n"
"So if you are using Kogito, you can now upgrade your applications to 2.7."
msgstr ""

msgid "gRPC"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Our gRPC extension only generated code for the application classes.\n"
"Starting with 2.7.1.Final, it also generates code from the dependencies."
msgstr ""

msgid "OIDC token propagation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We introduced a reactive counterpart to the OIDC token propagation "
"extension,\n"
"that you can use with RESTEasy Reactive."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.7.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.7.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
